WEBVTT

00:13:00.526 --> 00:13:01.693
In other words,

00:13:01.735 --> 00:13:05.072
he'd gotten the employees
and opened up the books,

00:13:05.113 --> 00:13:09.159
shared information and shared
decision making with them

00:13:09.201 --> 00:13:10.911
about what they needed to do.

00:13:11.245 --> 00:13:15.249
And that was a vastly different
leadership style

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:17.292
from the ones that they've been used to.

00:13:18.252 --> 00:13:21.672
Now right at the end,
we've got stimulating activism.

00:13:21.672 --> 00:13:25.300
This is when leaders say,
"Let's be the activist."

00:13:26.343 --> 00:13:29.888
This is the Ben and Jerry's
and the Patagonias of the world.

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:32.474
And they recruit activists.